---

<section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32 bg-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-8 leading-[1.1]">
      Potenciamos <br class="hidden md:block" />
      <span class="text-gray-400">tu visión.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-8 text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light">
      Transformamos ideas complejas en productos digitales simples.
      Ingeniería robusta y diseño estratégico para marcas que buscan el siguiente nivel.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-x-6">
      <a
        href="#contacto"
        class="group rounded-full bg-[#0071E3] px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-[#0077ED] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600 transition-all"
      >
        Empezar ahora
        <!-- ArrowRight icon inline -->
        <svg class="inline-block ml-2 w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M5 12h14" /><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#casos" class="text-base font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900 group">
        Ver trabajos <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Abstract Background Element -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full h-full -z-10 opacity-30 pointer-events-none">
    <div class="absolute top-[20%] left-[20%] w-72 h-72 bg-blue-100 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl animate-blob"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-[20%] right-[20%] w-72 h-72 bg-gray-100 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl animate-blob animation-delay-2000"></div>
  </div>
</section>
